  m_text: 'Wood: Furniture, paper, fabrics, lumber, etc.

    Paper: Books, cardboard
    boxes, documents, newspapers.

    Cloth: Clothing, draperies, bedding, upholstery.

    Rubber:
    Tires, hoses, seals.

    Plastics: Many common household plastics, though some
    specialized plastics might fall into other classes.

'
